<title>FINLAND: Finnish T-bill auction raises FIM 1.69 bln.</title>
<headline>Finnish T-bill auction raises FIM 1.69 bln.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the State Treasury Office's T-Bill auction July 1 versus June 24.</p>
<p>			THIS AUCTION/PREVIOUS AUCTION</p>
<p> Maturity, days   196/203		347/354</p>
<p> Avge yld, pct   3.15/3.16	     3.39/3.41</p>
<p> Highest yld     3.15/3.16	     3.39/3.41</p>
<p> Lowest  yld     3.15/3.16	     3.39/3.40</p>
<p> Amount,FIM million    20/100	     1,674/500</p>
<p> Bids, FIM million     25/900	     1,759/1,240</p>
<p>After today's auction, the outstanding amount of treasury bills is 45,728 million markka, the STO said.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@Reuters.fi</p>
</text>
